{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-orbea-avant-h40-h50-and-h45xi-bicycles-2512-0265","content_id":"45107142-254a-4d30-bba4-f776bb7b16a8","description":"Product Recall for Orbea Avant bicycles presenting a risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"6f732f7f-f884-4d5d-be35-88b25ec396af","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-23T22:37:14+00:00","id":"6f732f7f-f884-4d5d-be35-88b25ec396af","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-23T22:37:14+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694b199a2f02611393508a75/2512-0265-product-recall-orbea-avant-bicycles.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Orbea Avant H40, H50 and H45XI Bicycles</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries as the suspension forks can fail prematurely and crack, break or separate during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Cycles (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Orbea</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>Avant H40, H50, H45 XI</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Production Date</td>\n      <td>2025</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Fork Model</td>\n      <td>PN 50310000</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Spain (completed product), Cambodia (carbon fork)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Road bicycle under the Orbea Avant model range.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_6f732f7f-f884-4d5d-be35-88b25ec396af\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694b199a2f02611393508a75/2512-0265-product-recall-orbea-avant-bicycles.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-barcodes\">Affected Barcodes</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1180648651</td>\n      <td>1180648283</td>\n      <td>1180649158</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1180649183</td>\n      <td>1180648321</td>\n      <td>1180665896</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1180648014</td>\n      <td>1180665909</td>\n      <td>1180666774</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1180666557</td>\n      <td>1180660308</td>\n      <td>1180666556</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1180661779</td>\n      <td>1180662819</td>\n      <td>1180664749</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1180662428</td>\n      <td>1180650249</td>\n      <td>1180650453</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1180661725</td>\n      <td>1180650056</td>\n      <td>1180653290</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1180650924</td>\n      <td>1180673668</td>\n      <td>1180678781</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of injuries as the suspension forks can fail prematurely and crack, break or separate during use. The fork is a critical load-bearing component of the complete bicycle, and inadequate structural integrity may compromise steering and control during normal use, potentially leading to a loss of control and risk of injury.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users. \nOrbea recommend that consumers stop using the product immediately and visit <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.orbea.com/int-en/avant-support-centre/\">Avant Support Centre — Orbea</a> to check whether their bike fork is affected.</p>\n\n<p>Please contact <a href=\"mailto:Avantsupport@orbea.com\">Avantsupport@orbea.com</a> or (0044) 20 3468 4087 for further information and assistance.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0265</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-24T09:40:19Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-barcodes","level":3,"text":"Affected Barcodes"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-24","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-24T09:40:19+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-orbea-avant-h40-h50-and-h45xi-bicycles-2512-0265","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-orbea-avant-h40-h50-and-h45xi-bicycles-2512-0265","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-orbea-avant-h40-h50-and-h45xi-bicycles-2512-0265","content_id":"45107142-254a-4d30-bba4-f776bb7b16a8","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-12-24T09:40:19Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Orbea Avant H40, H50 and H45XI Bicycles (2512-0265)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-orbea-avant-h40-h50-and-h45xi-bicycles-2512-026